{"id": "0e7ff0e3-2a81-4e97-b95f-39f2cc917862", "slug": "resonance-array", "title": "Resonance Array", "description": null, "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Resonance Array\"\ndescription: \"LINK: VERIFIED\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#8EB364\"\n  secondary: \"#161F14\"\n  accent: \"#8EB364\"\n  background: \"#C9D1C1\"\n  surface: \"#161F14\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#C9D1C1\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Cormorant Garamond\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"DM Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"DM Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Resonance Array\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 10; favorites: 1; remixes: 0.\nTags: card, bento, dither, action, animated, webgl, effect.\n## Overview\nResonance Array is a Neuform Featured template imported as a reusable Aura DESIGN.md system.\n\nLINK: VERIFIED\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Resonance; Vector / Array.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #8EB364, secondary #161F14, accent #8EB364, background #C9D1C1, surface #161F14, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Cormorant Garamond for display moments and DM Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use DM Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Resonance Array</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;1,300;1,400&family=DM+Mono:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;1,300&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#c9d1c1] relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 md:p-12 overflow-hidden selection:bg-[#8eb364] selection:text-[#161f14]\">\n\n    <!-- Environment Physics Canvas (Rain, Splashes, Debris) -->\n    <canvas id=\"env-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none w-full h-full mix-blend-multiply opacity-80\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Main Container -->\n    <div id=\"main-card\" class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-[1400px] aspect-[4/3] md:aspect-[21/9] rounded-sm shadow-2xl overflow-hidden flex group cursor-crosshair\"\n         style=\"background-color: #161f14;\n                background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, #161f14 0px, #161f14 16px, #121a10 16px, #121a10 32px);\n                box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.4), inset 0 2px 4px rgba(255,255,255,0.05), inset 0 -4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\n                --mouse-x: 50%;\n                --mouse-y: 50%;\">\n\n        <!-- Blueprint Grid Overlay -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 opacity-50\"\n             style=\"background-size: 40px 40px; background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(142,179,100,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(142,179,100,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);\">\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Vertical Container-Size Lines -->\n        <div class=\"absolute left-[25%] top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-[#8eb364]/20 z-10 hidden md:flex flex-col justify-end pb-8 items-center\">\n            <span class=\"text-[#8eb364]/30 text-xs font-['DM_Mono'] uppercase tracking-widest\" style=\"writing-mode: vertical-rl;\">Vector-Prime</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"absolute left-[50%] top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-[#8eb364]/10 z-10 hidden md:block\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute left-[75%] top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-[#8eb364]/20 z-10 hidden md:flex flex-col justify-start pt-8 items-center\">\n            <span class=\"text-[#8eb364]/30 text-xs font-['DM_Mono'] uppercase tracking-widest\" style=\"writing-mode: vertical-rl;\">Vector-Sec</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Horizontal Lines -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-[33%] left-0 right-0 h-px bg-[#8eb364]/10 z-10 hidden md:block\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-[66%] left-0 right-0 h-px bg-[#8eb364]/10 z-10 hidden md:block\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Subtle Lighting Gradient -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0\"\n             style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, transparent 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.6) 100%);\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Flashlight Hover Effect -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none z-20 transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 border-2 border-[#8eb364]\"\n             style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(142,179,100,0.3) 0px, rgba(142,179,100,0.3) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 24px),\n                                      repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, rgba(142,179,100,0.3) 0px, rgba(142,179,100,0.3) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 24px);\n                    mask-image: radial-gradient(350px circle at var(--mouse-x) var(--mouse-y), black 0%, transparent 100%);\n                    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(350px circle at var(--mouse-x) var(--mouse-y), black 0%, transparent 100%);\">\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Architectural Corner Castings -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-8 h-8 border-b border-r border-[#8eb364]/40 z-30 flex items-start justify-start p-1.5\"><div class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-[#8eb364]/60\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-8 h-8 border-b border-l border-[#8eb364]/40 z-30 flex items-start justify-end p-1.5\"><div class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-[#8eb364]/60\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-8 h-8 border-t border-r border-[#8eb364]/40 z-30 flex items-end justify-start p-1.5\"><div class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-[#8eb364]/60\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-8 h-8 border-t border-l border-[#8eb364]/40 z-30 flex items-end justify-end p-1.5\"><div class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-[#8eb364]/60\"></div></div>\n\n        <!-- Floating Crosses -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none z-10\">\n            <span class=\"absolute top-[20%] left-[25%] text-[#8eb364] text-xs opacity-80 animate-pulse\" style=\"animation-duration: 4s;\">+</span>\n            <span class=\"absolute top-[30%] left-[35%] text-[#8eb364] text-xs opacity-60 animate-pulse\" style=\"animation-duration: 5s; animation-delay: 1s;\">+</span>\n            <span class=\"absolute bottom-[40%] left-[18%] text-[#8eb364] text-xs opacity-90 animate-pulse\" style=\"animation-duration: 3s; animation-delay: 2s;\">+</span>\n            <span class=\"absolute top-[25%] right-[30%] text-[#8eb364] text-xs opacity-70 animate-pulse\" style=\"animation-duration: 4.5s; animation-delay: 0.5s;\">+</span>\n            <span class=\"absolute bottom-[35%] right-[22%] text-[#8eb364] text-xs opacity-80 animate-pulse\" style=\"animation-duration: 3.5s; animation-delay: 1.5s;\">+</span>\n            <span class=\"absolute bottom-[20%] right-[10%] text-[#8eb364] text-xs opacity-60 animate-pulse\" style=\"animation-duration: 6s;\">+</span>\n            <span class=\"absolute bottom-[25%] left-[55%] text-[#8eb364] text-xs opacity-70 animate-pulse\" style=\"animation-duration: 4s; animation-delay: 0.8s;\">+</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Top Left Typography (01) -->\n        <div class=\"absolute left-6 md:left-12 top-6 md:top-12 z-30 pointer-events-none flex flex-col gap-1\">\n            <div class=\"font-['DM_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-[#8eb364]/60 mb-2 font-thin tracking-widest\">01 // BOOT</div>\n            <h1 class=\"font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-6xl md:text-8xl font-light tracking-tight text-[#c3d1b6] leading-none italic\">\n                Resonance\n            </h1>\n            <h2 class=\"font-['Space_Grotesk',sans-serif] text-2xl md:text-3xl font-thin tracking-tight text-[#8eb364] uppercase mt-1\">\n                Vector / Array\n            </h2>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Left Typography (02) -->\n        <div class=\"absolute left-6 md:left-12 bottom-6 md:bottom-12 z-30 pointer-events-none hidden md:flex flex-col items-center gap-6\">\n            <div class=\"font-['Space_Grotesk',sans-serif] text-xl md:text-2xl font-thin tracking-tight text-[#8eb364] uppercase opacity-80\" style=\"writing-mode: vertical-rl; transform: rotate(180deg);\">\n                System Active\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"font-['DM_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-[#8eb364]/60 font-thin tracking-widest\" style=\"writing-mode: vertical-rl; transform: rotate(180deg);\">02 // DIAG</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Top Right Typography (03 - Radar) -->\n        <div class=\"absolute right-6 md:right-12 top-6 md:top-12 z-30 pointer-events-none flex items-start gap-6\">\n            <div class=\"font-['DM_Mono',monospace] text-xs tracking-widest text-[#8eb364]/60 uppercase font-thin mt-1\">\n                03 // LOC\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-1.5 text-center text-[#c3d1b6] font-thin text-xs tracking-widest font-['Space_Grotesk',sans-serif]\">\n                <div class=\"col-start-2 text-[#8eb364]\">Y</div>\n                <div class=\"col-start-1 row-start-2\">-X</div>\n                <div class=\"col-start-2 row-start-2 flex items-center justify-center text-[#8eb364]\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:target-linear\" class=\"text-sm\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-start-3 row-start-2\">X</div>\n                <div class=\"col-start-2 row-start-3\">-Y</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Right Typography (04 - Data & Logs) -->\n        <div class=\"absolute right-6 md:right-12 bottom-6 md:bottom-12 z-30 pointer-events-none text-right flex flex-col items-end gap-3\">\n            <div class=\"font-['Space_Grotesk',sans-serif] text-5xl md:text-7xl font-light tracking-tight text-[#c3d1b6] leading-none flex items-start gap-4\">\n                <span class=\"font-['DM_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-[#8eb364]/60 font-thin tracking-widest mt-2\">04 // RES</span>\n                <div>08<span class=\"text-[#8eb364]\">.</span>45</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"font-['DM_Mono',monospace] text-xs text-[#c3d1b6] opacity-75 uppercase tracking-widest space-y-1 font-thin mt-2\">\n                <p>LINK: VERIFIED</p>\n                <p>ELEVATION: 3192 M</p>\n                <p>DATA SECURED</p>\n                <p>DELAY 08MS</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Center Canvas Animation -->\n        <canvas id=\"glitch-canvas\" class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-10 w-full h-full md:w-auto md:h-[120%] object-contain mix-blend-screen opacity-80\"></canvas>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Scripts -->\n    <script>\n        // --- Interactive Flashlight Hover Effect ---\n        const card = document.getElementById('main-card');\n        card.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n            const rect = card.getBoundingClientRect();\n            card.style.setProperty('--mouse-x', `${e.clientX - rect.left}px`);\n            card.style.setProperty('--mouse-y', `${e.clientY - rect.top}px`);\n        });\n\n        // --- Center Glitch/Oscillation Canvas ---\n        const gCanvas = document.getElementById('glitch-canvas');\n        const gCtx = gCanvas.getContext('2d');\n        const dpr = window.devicePixelRatio || 1;\n        gCanvas.width = 800 * dpr;\n        gCanvas.height = 800 * dpr;\n        gCtx.scale(dpr, dpr);\n\n        const baseWidths = [0, 0, 0, 0, 20, 20, 20, 20, 200, 180, 160, 140, 120, 100, 80, 60, 60, 55, 50, 45, 40, 35, 30, 25, 20, 15, 10, 5];\n        let time = 0;\n\n        function drawGlitch() {\n            gCtx.clearRect(0, 0, 800, 800);\n            gCtx.fillStyle = '#8eb364';\n            gCtx.fillRect(376, 376, 48, 48);\n            gCtx.clearRect(384, 384, 32, 32);\n            gCtx.fillRect(394, 394, 12, 12);\n\n            const drawRows = (dir) => {\n                for (let i = 0; i < baseWidths.length; i++) {\n                    if (baseWidths[i] === 0) continue;\n                    let animW = Math.max(0, baseWidths[i] + Math.sin(time * 2 + i * 0.2) * 10 + Math.cos(time * 1.5 - i * 0.1) * 5 + (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2);\n                    gCtx.fillRect(400 - animW, 400 + (i * 12 * dir) + (dir === 1 ? 12 : -12) - 4, animW * 2, 8);\n                }\n            };\n            drawRows(-1); drawRows(1);\n            time += 0.02;\n            requestAnimationFrame(drawGlitch);\n        }\n        drawGlitch();\n\n        // --- Environment Physics Canvas (Rain, Splash, Debris) ---\n        const envCanvas = document.getElementById('env-canvas');\n        const eCtx = envCanvas.getContext('2d', { alpha: true });\n        let w, h, cardRect;\n\n        function resizeEnv() {\n            w = envCanvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n            h = envCanvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n            cardRect = card.getBoundingClientRect();\n        }\n        window.addEventListener('resize', resizeEnv);\n        window.addEventListener('scroll', () => cardRect = card.getBoundingClientRect());\n        resizeEnv();\n\n        const debris = Array.from({length: 50}, () => ({\n            x: Math.random() * w, y: Math.random() * h,\n            vx: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.6, vy: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.6\n        }));\n\n        const rain = Array.from({length: 80}, () => ({\n            x: Math.random() * w, y: Math.random() * h,\n            vy: 12 + Math.random() * 8, l: 15 + Math.random() * 25\n        }));\n\n        const splashes = [];\n\n        function drawEnv() {\n            eCtx.clearRect(0, 0, w, h);\n\n            // Draw Debris & Connecting WebGL-style lines\n            eCtx.fillStyle = 'rgba(22, 31, 20, 0.4)';\n            eCtx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(22, 31, 20, 0.15)';\n            eCtx.lineWidth = 1;\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < debris.length; i++) {\n                let p = debris[i];\n                p.x += p.vx; p.y += p.vy;\n                if (p.x < 0 || p.x > w) p.vx *= -1;\n                if (p.y < 0 || p.y > h) p.vy *= -1;\n\n                eCtx.beginPath();\n                eCtx.arc(p.x, p.y, 1.5, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                eCtx.fill();\n\n                for (let j = i + 1; j < debris.length; j++) {\n                    let p2 = debris[j];\n                    let dist = Math.hypot(p.x - p2.x, p.y - p2.y);\n                    if (dist < 100) {\n                        eCtx.beginPath();\n                        eCtx.moveTo(p.x, p.y);\n                        eCtx.lineTo(p2.x, p2.y);\n                        eCtx.stroke();\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            // Draw Rain & Process Layout Collisions\n            eCtx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(22, 31, 20, 0.5)';\n            for (let r of rain) {\n                r.y += r.vy;\n\n                // Collision check with the top edge of the layout card\n                if (r.y > cardRect.top && r.y - r.vy <= cardRect.top && r.x > cardRect.left && r.x < cardRect.right) {\n                    for(let s = 0; s < 5; s++) {\n                        splashes.push({\n                            x: r.x, y: cardRect.top,\n                            vx: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 5,\n                            vy: -Math.random() * 4 - 2,\n                            life: 1\n                        });\n                    }\n                    r.y = -r.l;\n                    r.x = Math.random() * w;\n                } else if (r.y > h) {\n                    r.y = -r.l;\n                    r.x = Math.random() * w;\n                }\n\n                eCtx.beginPath();\n                eCtx.moveTo(r.x, r.y);\n                eCtx.lineTo(r.x, r.y - r.l);\n                eCtx.stroke();\n            }\n\n            // Draw Splash Particles\n            for (let i = splashes.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n                let s = splashes[i];\n                s.x += s.vx;\n                s.y += s.vy;\n                s.vy += 0.25; // gravity\n                s.life -= 0.03;\n\n                if (s.life <= 0) {\n                    splashes.splice(i, 1);\n                    continue;\n                }\n\n                eCtx.fillStyle = `rgba(22, 31, 20, ${s.life * 0.8})`;\n                eCtx.beginPath();\n                eCtx.arc(s.x, s.y, 1.2, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                eCtx.fill();\n            }\n\n            requestAnimationFrame(drawEnv);\n        }\n        drawEnv();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "resonance-array.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/resonance-array.jpg", "source_name": "resonance-array-DESIGN.md", "views": 111, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T03:04:09.283407+00:00"}